WEBVTT

00:46.254 --> 00:49.549
Daeho once suffered
a long, unprecedented drought.

00:52.844 --> 00:54.763
It was so severe that it caused

00:54.846 --> 00:57.557
Lake Gyeongcheondaeho
to dry up completely.

01:03.980 --> 01:06.566
To fill the lake back up with energy,

01:06.649 --> 01:09.694
the mages of Daeho performed a grand rite.

01:15.283 --> 01:18.703
Enormous hailstones began
to fall from the sky.

01:30.048 --> 01:32.300
But among the hailstones
that fell that day,

01:32.383 --> 01:34.761
there was one that did not melt.

01:36.679 --> 01:41.601
That piece of unmelted ice
turned into fire,

01:42.268 --> 01:43.561
then into stone,

01:44.062 --> 01:46.106
and finally water,

01:46.815 --> 01:50.276
before returning to its original ice form.

01:51.111 --> 01:53.822
In that process,
it produced a black powder

01:55.198 --> 01:59.911
known as the Soul Ejector,
used for the alchemy of souls.

02:03.832 --> 02:06.292
The power of the Soul Ejector
was astonishing.

02:07.961 --> 02:11.840
It summoned the soul back into
its dead body to bring it back to life.

02:12.423 --> 02:15.343
Exchanged the souls of two bodies.

02:17.220 --> 02:22.142
Sucked the souls out of living people
and stole their energy.

02:28.273 --> 02:30.608
And eventually, that astonishing power

02:31.359 --> 02:32.861
brought forth chaos.

02:42.036 --> 02:44.164
In order to possess
the never-melting ice stone

02:44.247 --> 02:46.124
that produced the Soul Ejector,

02:46.916 --> 02:51.713
the mages fought a bloody war,
turning Daeho into a living hell.

03:00.972 --> 03:02.807
The man who ended that long war…

03:05.351 --> 03:09.355
was the founder of Songrim,
Master Seo Gyeong.

03:19.115 --> 03:20.909
And he taught me everything.

03:20.992 --> 03:23.661
So the ice stone is
an amazing thing.

03:23.745 --> 03:26.706
So where is it? I want to see it.

03:26.789 --> 03:29.334
It is an extremely frightening stone.

03:29.417 --> 03:31.753
The sorcery performed with its power

03:31.836 --> 03:34.839
also created strange objects
that hurt people.

03:35.673 --> 03:38.134
Child, where did you get that doll?

03:38.676 --> 03:40.553
I found it in the mountains.

03:44.307 --> 03:46.434
Would you trade it for these chestnuts?

03:47.018 --> 03:47.894
Yeah!

03:48.811 --> 03:49.646
Hmm.

03:56.069 --> 03:59.155
This is not just an ordinary toy,
it's a cursed relic.

04:07.038 --> 04:08.206
Wow!

04:08.289 --> 04:09.624
What was that?

04:09.707 --> 04:12.752
These are dangerous things created
by powerful sorcery.

04:12.835 --> 04:15.672
Oh, I know.
They're called relics, aren't they?

04:16.297 --> 04:17.507
They're at Jinyowon.

04:19.175 --> 04:20.009
Yeah.

04:20.510 --> 04:23.346
In Jinyowon, there're even
more dangerous relics.

04:24.681 --> 04:27.809
Many strange items made
with the power of the ice stone

04:27.892 --> 04:29.227
are locked away there.

04:36.234 --> 04:40.655
And there they stay, waiting for a chance
to come out into the world again.

04:54.294 --> 04:55.295
Should I take you in?

04:56.671 --> 04:57.588
No, sir.

04:59.007 --> 05:01.634
Although I may be a filthy girl
avoided by everyone,

05:02.343 --> 05:05.179
I refuse to serve just anyone,
Your Royal Highness.

05:05.263 --> 05:07.432
That rude girl.

05:08.349 --> 05:09.934
She should have just said
"I would be honored".

05:10.018 --> 05:14.272
The scent of cinnamon in this batch
of cinnamon and ginger wine is excellent.

05:14.355 --> 05:15.982
Oh, goodness.
Thank you so much, Your Highness.

05:19.027 --> 05:20.528
Smells just like cinnamon.

05:24.324 --> 05:25.575
Insolent girl.

05:25.658 --> 05:27.160
Is something amiss, Your Royal Highness?

05:27.243 --> 05:29.954
Filthy Mu-deok got her filth on me.

05:30.538 --> 05:31.831
The stench will not go away.

05:32.457 --> 05:34.959
But you smell wonderful.

05:38.463 --> 05:39.881
Enough. Leave.

05:40.923 --> 05:41.883
I said "Leave"!

05:41.966 --> 05:43.092
Yes, Your Highness.

05:50.892 --> 05:53.394
I saved her, rescued her,

05:53.978 --> 05:56.481
gave her my sachet and a silk dress.

06:04.781 --> 06:05.948
Ungrateful girl.

06:11.079 --> 06:13.247
- I am honored.
- Did I not tell you to…

06:20.421 --> 06:21.381
Filthy Mu-deok?

06:21.881 --> 06:23.257
How did you get in here?

06:24.509 --> 06:27.345
I have that sachet that you bestowed
upon me, Your Royal Highness.

06:28.971 --> 06:32.308
Well, I suppose you need something again.

06:32.392 --> 06:34.894
I know you have been
thinking about me, Your Highness,

06:34.977 --> 06:36.145
so I came to see you.

06:36.229 --> 06:38.356
Are you saying you know
how to read my mind?

06:41.859 --> 06:42.902
Well, good then.

06:44.278 --> 06:48.324
While you're here, have a glass
of very strong cinnamon and ginger wine.

06:56.249 --> 06:57.375
Mm.

06:57.458 --> 06:59.585
It does smell really wonderful.

07:01.421 --> 07:02.463
It does?

07:06.759 --> 07:09.846
I must say, I really do like this place.

07:12.348 --> 07:15.017
If you continue to think of me
just as you did today,

07:15.101 --> 07:17.854
Your Royal Highness,
I will come and visit you.

07:30.241 --> 07:32.285
The palace is indeed great.

07:36.038 --> 07:37.373
Do you know why…

07:39.542 --> 07:41.961
I continue to think about you here…

07:44.046 --> 07:46.507
in this place of soft silk, confined wine?

07:50.511 --> 07:52.180
You're Filthy Mu-deok.

07:55.224 --> 07:57.310
But at this moment,
you do not reek of filth.

07:58.811 --> 08:00.730
Highness.

08:00.813 --> 08:01.689
Who are you?

08:07.778 --> 08:08.613
Ah.

08:11.365 --> 08:12.408
You caught me.

08:26.631 --> 08:28.257
Something wicked was in here.

08:28.341 --> 08:30.384
- Search the place.
- Yes, Your Highness.

08:34.889 --> 08:36.724
Why did it appear as that girl?

08:44.899 --> 08:46.943
- Search every corner.
- Yes.

08:51.572 --> 08:53.282
The Crown Prince is here, my lady.

08:54.033 --> 08:54.867
The Crown Prince?

09:02.542 --> 09:04.001
I've come looking for someone.

09:04.085 --> 09:05.836
I was told I could find her here.

09:07.463 --> 09:10.508
Is something going on?
I heard a ruckus.

09:11.092 --> 09:14.345
A servant caused trouble and disappeared,
so we were looking for her.

09:14.428 --> 09:15.429
A servant?

09:15.513 --> 09:17.265
She's not of our household.

09:17.348 --> 09:19.517
She serves the Jang family. Mu-deok.

09:19.600 --> 09:21.227
She's the very one I'm here for.

09:22.228 --> 09:23.771
Did something happen with her?

09:25.690 --> 09:26.524
That servant…

09:27.984 --> 09:30.820
broke the yin-yang jade
that was meant to be used to make…

09:31.571 --> 09:32.863
my wedding rings.

09:37.702 --> 09:39.328
I told you to be careful.

09:39.870 --> 09:41.205
What will you do about this?

09:41.914 --> 09:43.124
I'm very sorry, my lady.

09:43.749 --> 09:45.001
Please, spare me!

09:45.543 --> 09:46.919
I will summon her master.

09:47.420 --> 09:49.505
For now, take her
and lock her up in the annex.

09:52.633 --> 09:53.634
Please, spare me!

09:53.718 --> 09:54.594
I am sorry!

09:55.595 --> 09:57.555
Perhaps she was
scared of being punished.

09:57.638 --> 10:01.100
But while she was locked up,
she stole the broken jade and ran away.

10:05.354 --> 10:07.398
Seeing as we still have not found her,

10:07.481 --> 10:10.318
it seems that she already made her escape.

10:12.278 --> 10:13.779
She got scared and ran away?

10:14.822 --> 10:16.157
A bold girl like her?

10:19.035 --> 10:20.786
Mages from Jeongjingak are here.

10:29.211 --> 10:32.214
What… brings you here, Your Highness?

10:32.298 --> 10:33.883
What brings you here, Yul?

10:34.467 --> 10:35.468
I'm looking for someone.

10:36.510 --> 10:39.013
Are you… also looking for Mu-deok?

10:39.722 --> 10:40.556
Yes.

10:41.807 --> 10:43.017
I am looking for Mu-deok.

10:51.192 --> 10:53.235
She broke the yin-yang jade,

10:53.319 --> 10:55.613
and then ran away with it
to avoid punishment.

10:56.364 --> 10:59.325
But why did you not
have the wedding rings made?

11:00.368 --> 11:04.038
I went to Chwiseonru to lend you my hand,
but they said you left in a hurry.

11:06.207 --> 11:08.501
I… I just postponed it.

11:10.753 --> 11:12.463
Yul, why are you looking for Mu-deok?

11:13.089 --> 11:16.634
I, too, saw the illusion that you did,
Your Royal Highness.

11:36.737 --> 11:38.364
How did you come into Songrim?

11:41.200 --> 11:43.536
I came because you kept thinking of me.

11:46.914 --> 11:47.957
What do you mean?

11:49.458 --> 11:51.544
You were longing for
the one you met at Danhyanggok.

11:51.627 --> 11:53.129
Stop fooling around.

11:53.212 --> 11:54.338
What do you mean "longing"?

11:55.214 --> 11:57.049
- I would never.
- You are lying.

11:57.133 --> 11:58.968
You still have
the whistle with you, right?

12:03.472 --> 12:05.808
You barely noticed the pain in your leg.

12:06.809 --> 12:08.894
And you were not scared to be scolded.

12:11.105 --> 12:12.940
Because you liked me so much.

12:18.904 --> 12:20.322
If you keep thinking of me…

12:28.789 --> 12:30.124
I will visit you.

12:36.130 --> 12:36.964
You are…

12:37.965 --> 12:39.008
You cannot be human.

12:50.144 --> 12:51.395
You're getting rid of me?

12:53.522 --> 12:55.274
Then you'll never see me again.

13:26.514 --> 13:28.432
It wasn't her. It was an illusion.

13:30.017 --> 13:32.686
Then, does that mean
what I saw was also an illusion?

13:32.770 --> 13:35.564
It was odd, so I went to
Chwiseonru to find her.

13:36.148 --> 13:38.484
And they told me
that she was dragged here.

13:38.567 --> 13:41.153
She wasn't dragged.
She was here to run an errand.

13:41.946 --> 13:44.573
And she's disappeared
with the precious treasure.

13:45.407 --> 13:48.160
We're not in search of an illusion,
we're in search of a thief.

13:53.833 --> 13:54.959
Here comes her master, now.

14:10.516 --> 14:13.394
Is Master Lee not here today, either?

14:13.894 --> 14:16.188
He's always been the wandering sort.

14:16.897 --> 14:18.399
He brought this dog and left.

14:19.149 --> 14:22.111
Was this Gwigu also made
from the ice stone?

14:22.194 --> 14:25.948
Master Seo Gyeong made it
with the energy from the ice stone

14:26.031 --> 14:28.200
to sniff out traces of sorcery.

14:29.326 --> 14:31.495
Uk broke Gwigu's pottery,

14:31.579 --> 14:35.040
so Master Lee
brought the spirit from Jinyowon

14:35.708 --> 14:37.376
and put it inside this little dog.

14:37.459 --> 14:40.754
And you're sure you really do not know
where Master Seo Gyeong…

14:41.922 --> 14:43.173
sealed the ice stone, either?

14:43.257 --> 14:44.091
Hmm.

14:45.050 --> 14:46.010
I do not.

14:46.510 --> 14:49.722
You think the alchemy of souls
started again because someone

14:49.805 --> 14:52.141
has managed to unseal the ice stone?

14:53.809 --> 14:56.896
The only way to shift souls
without first mastering Hwansu

14:57.771 --> 14:59.273
is to use the ice stone.

14:59.815 --> 15:02.651
I'm quite certain that
someone has unsealed it

15:03.277 --> 15:04.820
and brought it into the world again.

15:06.363 --> 15:08.115
If so, it's a disaster.

15:08.198 --> 15:12.328
We must not repeat
the chaos of two centuries ago.

15:13.996 --> 15:17.124
We must find the ice stone,
no matter what it takes.

15:26.800 --> 15:28.969
I was given orders to give this to you.

15:39.396 --> 15:42.316
I thought you were going
to lie low for a while.

15:42.399 --> 15:45.653
Are you planning
to shift another soul, then?

15:49.573 --> 15:51.200
Tell them that I received this.

15:51.742 --> 15:53.243
Yes.

16:00.250 --> 16:02.670
Hurry up and find a eunuch
who can replace him.

16:05.089 --> 16:08.801
You will be shifted into that body,
so choose wisely, Gil-ju.

16:08.884 --> 16:09.718
Yes.

16:11.095 --> 16:15.307
I did not serve the Danju
just to shift into a body of a eunuch.

16:17.393 --> 16:18.644
If I use Naksu,

16:19.979 --> 16:21.897
I can get the body I want.

16:31.031 --> 16:33.659
My servant has committed
a grave sin against you.

16:33.742 --> 16:35.911
As her master, I'm fully to blame.

16:37.037 --> 16:38.205
And I apologize.

16:41.542 --> 16:45.129
You must be upset to lose the jade
that was meant for the wedding rings.

16:46.338 --> 16:48.674
I begged my mother for that yin-yang jade.

16:49.800 --> 16:51.635
They say that
if your rings are made with it,

16:51.719 --> 16:53.262
you will grow old together.

16:54.847 --> 16:56.223
But it is broken now.

16:56.306 --> 16:58.475
I did not know
it held such a deep meaning.

16:59.268 --> 17:00.936
I must say, I'm upset as well.

17:02.312 --> 17:04.523
We will find you a more valuable jade

17:04.606 --> 17:06.525
which you can use
to help make your wedding rings.

17:09.278 --> 17:11.905
Since your apology is sincere,
I will accept it.

17:12.531 --> 17:14.700
- You may all leave now.
- Thank you.

17:14.783 --> 17:15.701
I cannot do that.

17:17.995 --> 17:19.246
I need to find Mu-deok.

17:22.124 --> 17:24.460
I won't rest
until we catch that wicked servant

17:24.960 --> 17:27.171
and recover the yin-yang jade
for you as well.

17:28.005 --> 17:31.925
She's weak and, uh, has short legs,
so she will not have gone far.

17:33.052 --> 17:36.388
Please, permit me to stay
so I can look for her.

17:41.018 --> 17:42.352
Go ahead if you must.

17:43.270 --> 17:44.313
Thank you, my lady.

17:44.980 --> 17:48.317
Now that I have your permission,
would you please open it?

17:50.611 --> 17:52.404
The place of relics and artifacts.

17:53.405 --> 17:55.032
Open the door to Jinyowon.

18:14.718 --> 18:18.138
Jinyowon can only be opened
by a member of the Jin family.

18:18.222 --> 18:22.184
Right now, Cho-yeon and I
are the only ones who can open this door.

18:23.102 --> 18:25.104
It's impossible that she's in there.

18:25.187 --> 18:26.688
I'm sure I saw Mu-deok's illusion.

18:29.566 --> 18:31.068
Perhaps you were seeing things.

18:32.027 --> 18:35.030
How can you be sure
the illusion was created by a relic?

18:35.114 --> 18:36.073
I saw it, too.

18:37.991 --> 18:39.827
I'm certain it was an illusion
in Mu-deok's form.

18:41.787 --> 18:43.789
All the relics with the power
to create illusions

18:43.872 --> 18:45.415
should be inside Jinyowon, are they not?

18:45.499 --> 18:47.209
Please, let me go inside and check.

18:47.751 --> 18:49.962
Very well. I will open the door.

18:51.505 --> 18:55.300
However, this place is filled
with dangerous relics and artifacts.

18:56.718 --> 18:58.887
You could become possessed
and trapped inside.

19:00.264 --> 19:02.683
Young Master, it's too dangerous.

19:03.934 --> 19:05.269
I will go with him.

19:09.314 --> 19:10.315
I'll go as well.

19:15.362 --> 19:16.363
It sounds fun.

19:16.989 --> 19:19.491
When will I get
another chance to see inside?

19:43.807 --> 19:45.225
Go on inside.

19:45.309 --> 19:46.852
I'll give you no more than an hour.

20:02.201 --> 20:03.994
We should inform the leader.

20:08.040 --> 20:09.124
Mu-deok.

20:10.042 --> 20:11.251
Mu-deok!

20:15.923 --> 20:17.883
Hmm, so this is Jinyowon.

20:19.676 --> 20:21.803
They say every item
in here is so precious,

20:21.887 --> 20:23.805
they cannot be bought with money.

20:23.889 --> 20:26.266
Will you please be quiet?
We are not on tour.

20:27.476 --> 20:29.102
Are these all yours?

20:29.770 --> 20:33.315
Well, I suppose if you marry
into the Jin family, they will be.

20:33.899 --> 20:35.692
I envy you.

20:35.776 --> 20:38.403
All of these treasures
will become yours, Jin Uk.

20:39.404 --> 20:40.989
If you're so envious,

20:41.073 --> 20:42.699
you can get married instead,
Your Highness.

20:43.492 --> 20:45.118
But even if it all was yours,

20:45.202 --> 20:47.037
how could you touch them
when you're so scared?

20:47.120 --> 20:48.372
You're not even good at spells.

20:48.455 --> 20:50.791
You think your spells are powerful enough
to touch anything?

20:51.667 --> 20:54.670
Well, Lady Jin told us
not to touch anything.

20:54.753 --> 20:57.756
What an excuse!
You're just too scared to touch them.

21:04.263 --> 21:05.097
What was that?

21:05.180 --> 21:06.223
What was that?

21:08.517 --> 21:09.476
Is everyone all right?

21:10.143 --> 21:11.645
It seems
there's something odd in there.

21:12.688 --> 21:14.231
Were you not startled?

21:15.482 --> 21:16.817
I was startled.

21:17.985 --> 21:19.820
Be careful in the dark, Your Highness.

21:22.906 --> 21:24.324
Was he really startled?

21:24.408 --> 21:26.910
Yes. When he's startled,
he loses his sense of direction.

21:26.994 --> 21:28.829
Yul, not that way! Hey!

21:28.912 --> 21:30.872
Goodness, we… we have to go the other way.

21:31.623 --> 21:33.667
Go that way. That way.

21:38.130 --> 21:39.589
Let us all try to be careful.

21:42.843 --> 21:44.219
So even cool-headed Seo Yul

21:44.928 --> 21:47.389
loses his way when he is startled.

21:47.973 --> 21:48.890
Indeed.

21:54.730 --> 21:56.231
Uh, be careful, Your Highness.

21:57.482 --> 21:58.734
Careful yourself.

22:00.319 --> 22:01.653
Let us stick together.

22:37.981 --> 22:40.192
How did I get stuck here?

22:52.204 --> 22:53.580
I should have held it in.

22:55.415 --> 22:57.417
I should never have provoked that girl.

22:59.378 --> 23:00.921
I told you to be careful.

23:01.004 --> 23:04.049
Wait here.
Young Master Jang will be here soon.

23:04.633 --> 23:07.260
My lady, what's going to happen to me?

23:07.344 --> 23:10.430
What do you think?
You'll be severely punished.

23:11.223 --> 23:12.599
I'm not worried about that.

23:13.558 --> 23:14.726
They say that if you break the jade,

23:14.810 --> 23:19.106
the rest of your relationships
with lovers are destined to break, too.

23:21.149 --> 23:22.526
What am I going to do now?

23:24.277 --> 23:26.029
What are you talking about?

23:26.113 --> 23:28.031
Stop talking such nonsense.

23:28.573 --> 23:30.242
If you break that yin-yang jade,

23:30.325 --> 23:33.453
they say that you'll never ever
end up with the person you love.

23:34.079 --> 23:36.957
That's what all the gisaengs
at Chwiseonru are saying.

23:37.040 --> 23:38.208
Is…

23:38.291 --> 23:39.543
Is that really true?

23:39.626 --> 23:40.460
Yes.

23:41.420 --> 23:45.215
Did you not know that already,
Young Lady Jin?

23:45.841 --> 23:47.342
That cannot be.

23:49.761 --> 23:51.346
Then what's going to happen to me?

23:55.267 --> 23:56.935
Why are you worried, my lady,

23:57.644 --> 23:59.396
when I was the one who broke it?

24:03.984 --> 24:05.861
It was you who broke the jade, wasn't it?

24:06.736 --> 24:09.823
And you made me carry the box
so that you could place the blame on me.

24:10.699 --> 24:11.658
Am I right?

24:12.909 --> 24:14.953
If you felt wronged,
you should have said so

24:15.036 --> 24:17.080
in front of my mother
when you had the chance.

24:17.164 --> 24:19.583
Would Lady Jin have sat back
and let me get away with it

24:20.083 --> 24:22.419
if I'd publicly humiliated her daughter?

24:23.003 --> 24:24.212
I'm not scared of you.

24:24.963 --> 24:28.508
But I am a little bit scared
of your mother, the leader of Jinyowon.

24:31.803 --> 24:33.305
Are you that frightened of your mother?

24:33.889 --> 24:36.808
It is true that I fear her,
but I hate you.

24:37.934 --> 24:38.977
I'm going to sell you.

24:39.853 --> 24:42.272
Like you said,
my mother is a frightening woman.

24:42.355 --> 24:45.734
And as punishment for what you did,
she's going to send you away.

24:45.817 --> 24:47.152
Somewhere far away!

25:28.443 --> 25:30.320
Did she run away?

26:02.018 --> 26:04.187
Should I try
climbing over this wall?

26:42.767 --> 26:44.811
How did she open
the door to Jinyowon?

26:52.360 --> 26:55.030
So this is the Jin family's Jinyowon.

26:58.617 --> 27:02.162
If she gets locked in, she could die.

27:28.980 --> 27:30.106
Hey.

27:37.405 --> 27:38.782
So it really is you.

27:43.078 --> 27:44.412
It's been a while.

28:12.065 --> 28:13.233
You can't leave.

28:15.193 --> 28:16.486
It won't break.

28:18.405 --> 28:19.823
Nothing will work!

28:23.868 --> 28:24.953
Just shut up!

28:35.463 --> 28:38.007
A girl who can't even
cast spells went in there.

28:38.091 --> 28:39.676
Could she have died?

28:40.176 --> 28:42.011
They said they saw her illusion.

28:46.099 --> 28:47.225
Young Lady Jin.

28:48.435 --> 28:49.394
I think I…

28:50.353 --> 28:52.355
Every time you move, I hear something.

28:54.232 --> 28:55.066
It sounds like…

28:55.859 --> 28:58.111
jade clinking together.

29:12.500 --> 29:13.752
Mu-deok!

29:21.593 --> 29:23.678
The hour is up. We must leave.

29:23.762 --> 29:26.055
I must find her. I'm staying here.

29:26.139 --> 29:29.517
This place is too large
for just the three of us to search.

29:29.601 --> 29:32.854
You only came to see inside Jinyowon,
so you can leave, Your Highness.

29:34.731 --> 29:36.524
How did you get
Mu-deok's illusion to come out?

29:37.567 --> 29:39.027
I don't know where it came from.

29:39.819 --> 29:40.653
But…

29:43.782 --> 29:46.034
I came because you kept thinking of me.

29:46.576 --> 29:47.660
That's right.

29:47.744 --> 29:48.828
She said that to me too.

29:49.454 --> 29:51.039
She came to me because I thought of her.

29:51.122 --> 29:54.876
So, if you think of Mu-deok,
her illusion appears before you.

29:55.627 --> 29:56.878
So, you did not see it.

29:57.545 --> 29:59.130
She visited me and Yul,

29:59.214 --> 30:01.800
but not you,
even though you are her master.

30:01.883 --> 30:04.677
Why in the world were you thinking
about Mu-deok, Your Highness?

30:08.556 --> 30:10.725
I was drinking wine,
and it reminded me of her.

30:10.809 --> 30:13.812
So, you were the one who got Mu-deok
drunk and reeking of cinnamon?

30:13.895 --> 30:14.854
Yes, indeed.

30:15.855 --> 30:17.816
I also gave her a sachet that day.

30:17.899 --> 30:20.735
So the cinnamon that you smelled
probably came from my sachet.

30:21.736 --> 30:23.279
Ah, right.

30:23.780 --> 30:26.449
The sachet that she hung
by the toilet to get rid of the flies?

30:27.116 --> 30:28.535
The-- By the toilet?

30:28.618 --> 30:31.913
Thank you very much, Your Highness.
I was able to do my business comfortably.

30:33.832 --> 30:36.376
Yul, what were you doing
when you saw her illusion?

30:39.254 --> 30:40.088
The mirror.

30:41.673 --> 30:44.133
- My mirror broke.
- So did the one in my room.

30:47.136 --> 30:48.513
Maybe it came through the mirror.

30:51.224 --> 30:52.058
The mirror?

30:57.689 --> 30:58.523
Is this it?

31:10.076 --> 31:12.203
That's not you, either.
It's fake.

31:12.287 --> 31:13.496
It's an illusion.

31:22.463 --> 31:23.506
So it is you.

31:30.054 --> 31:31.514
She is trapped inside the mirror?

31:32.724 --> 31:33.850
Correct.

31:33.933 --> 31:37.020
We are unable to see what's inside,
but we're certain she's in there.

31:37.687 --> 31:38.897
The Mirror of Longing.

31:40.064 --> 31:41.316
Longing?

31:41.399 --> 31:43.776
That mirror is a relic
that creates delusions.

31:44.402 --> 31:47.280
It uses other mirrors to show
the illusions of things

31:47.363 --> 31:48.406
that people long for.

31:49.532 --> 31:52.201
It seems she was sucked inside
while standing in front of it,

31:52.285 --> 31:54.287
since she has no abilities.

31:55.413 --> 31:57.749
We need to get Mu-deok out of the mirror.

31:57.832 --> 32:01.294
Since Jinyowon's energy is so strong,
we cannot do it with our spells.

32:02.712 --> 32:04.505
Please, remove the mirror from Jinyowon.

32:05.548 --> 32:06.716
I cannot move the mirror.

32:08.051 --> 32:10.011
That relic has swallowed a human.

32:10.094 --> 32:12.055
It is too dangerous to bring it outside.

32:13.640 --> 32:15.308
As Crown Prince, I order you.

32:15.391 --> 32:16.517
Go bring out the mirror.

32:19.062 --> 32:22.774
Jinyowon is protected by a plaque

32:22.857 --> 32:25.568
from The Unanimous Assembly
for situations like this.

32:27.904 --> 32:31.199
Even if the king commands it,
I don't have to take it out.

32:34.035 --> 32:35.370
Uk will not come out of there…

32:36.704 --> 32:37.997
while Mu-deok's trapped inside.

32:38.081 --> 32:40.541
That's out of my control.
He'll have to stay inside then.

32:41.376 --> 32:43.753
Once the hour I promised you is over,

32:43.836 --> 32:45.713
I will seal the door to Jinyowon.

32:48.841 --> 32:49.759
Mother.

32:50.635 --> 32:52.637
I found it. The jade.

32:55.974 --> 32:58.017
Mu-deok must not have stolen it after all.

32:59.060 --> 33:00.603
Now that I have found it,

33:00.687 --> 33:03.189
please bring out the mirror
and get her out of there.

33:03.272 --> 33:05.984
If Young Master Jang is locked
in there, he will die.

33:06.901 --> 33:07.860
You stay out of this.

33:09.821 --> 33:12.907
Once the agreed time is over,
I shall seal the door again.

33:28.548 --> 33:30.133
It's no use!

33:30.216 --> 33:32.260
You can't break it, and you know it.

33:32.343 --> 33:34.303
Just shut up! You're an illusion.

33:34.387 --> 33:36.973
Yes. And I am…

33:38.057 --> 33:39.976
a delusion that reflects yourself.

33:44.564 --> 33:47.316
Humans can't see themselves
with their own eyes.

33:47.400 --> 33:49.694
They need a mirror to behold themselves.

33:50.987 --> 33:53.531
So the perceptions that
you have about yourself…

33:54.615 --> 33:56.200
are just a delusion.

33:59.996 --> 34:03.082
The same can be said
for how others perceive you.

34:03.916 --> 34:07.920
Just another delusion.
They see only what they want to see.

34:10.590 --> 34:11.924
Nothing is real.

34:12.592 --> 34:13.926
If this is true,

34:15.136 --> 34:17.638
that means everyone only sees
nothing but illusions.

34:18.890 --> 34:19.766
That's right.

34:20.725 --> 34:24.353
So I conjure the form they long for
the most and show them that.

34:28.107 --> 34:29.776
I'll do the same for you.

34:37.200 --> 34:39.494
Give me your energy. And then…

34:41.079 --> 34:43.081
I promise I'll make you perfect.

34:49.253 --> 34:50.129
But…

34:51.756 --> 34:54.634
you need my reflection
to create this illusion, don't you?

34:56.010 --> 34:56.844
Huh?

34:57.720 --> 34:59.305
If it isn't reflecting anything…

35:01.557 --> 35:02.975
a mirror becomes useless.

35:23.496 --> 35:25.748
All that for a piece of glass just used…

35:27.625 --> 35:28.668
for combing hair.

35:30.628 --> 35:31.546
Mu-deok!

35:32.797 --> 35:34.382
Mu-deok! Are you in there?

35:36.050 --> 35:36.926
Mu-deok!

35:38.678 --> 35:39.512
Jang Uk.

35:42.682 --> 35:43.724
Uk!

35:45.601 --> 35:47.186
Uk, I am in here!

35:49.564 --> 35:50.606
I found you.

35:58.239 --> 35:59.157
Time is up.

36:00.533 --> 36:02.702
Cho-yeon, go seal the door off right now.

36:02.785 --> 36:03.870
Mother.

36:04.871 --> 36:06.122
Do it now!

36:06.205 --> 36:08.040
Please wait a moment.

36:19.343 --> 36:20.928
Allow me to go inside myself.

36:22.388 --> 36:24.348
If the relic cannot be removed
from Jinyowon,

36:24.432 --> 36:27.268
then I will go in there
and retrieve the girl

36:27.351 --> 36:28.811
trapped in the Mirror of Longing.

36:28.895 --> 36:31.981
You're a high-level mage.
How can I trust you to go in there?

36:32.064 --> 36:33.357
Please, believe me.

36:34.150 --> 36:36.736
I will not touch any other artifacts.

36:36.819 --> 36:38.196
Why should I?

36:38.279 --> 36:41.574
My trust was broken once before,
also by a Songrim mage.

36:43.701 --> 36:47.121
Have you ever allowed a Songrim mage
to enter into Jinyowon before?

36:50.041 --> 36:51.667
If you want to save Jang Uk,

36:51.751 --> 36:55.588
you must ask the mages of Jeongjingak
so they can drag him out of there.

36:59.759 --> 37:00.801
My lord.

37:00.885 --> 37:02.053
We are running out of time.

37:05.598 --> 37:07.975
Yul, I want you to go in there

37:08.726 --> 37:10.311
and bring Uk out with you.

37:15.858 --> 37:16.734
Mu-deok.

37:18.069 --> 37:19.195
While you were gone,

37:20.655 --> 37:22.198
I sat down and started thinking.

37:23.991 --> 37:25.201
Thinking about…

37:26.619 --> 37:28.704
what I need to do to keep you by my side.

37:31.999 --> 37:33.876
If I become Cheonbugwan's Gwanju,

37:35.795 --> 37:37.463
you'll be Assistant Gwanju.

37:38.381 --> 37:40.049
Why would I want that?

37:40.132 --> 37:42.802
You said you didn't want
to stay by my side as a servant.

37:42.885 --> 37:45.721
We can't tell anyone that
you are my master, and I'm your pupil.

37:45.805 --> 37:48.349
But if you are
my Assistant Gwanju, you'll stay.

37:48.432 --> 37:51.560
You will be Cheonbugwan's Gwanju
with a soul shifter by your side?

37:53.479 --> 37:54.313
You are mad.

37:57.942 --> 38:00.069
I thought about it
when I heard about my marriage.

38:01.320 --> 38:03.197
"So, he finally has a way out."

38:04.365 --> 38:05.783
"What if he abandons me?"

38:07.868 --> 38:09.787
You must have felt lost thinking that.

38:15.751 --> 38:17.211
But now that you are gone,

38:19.714 --> 38:20.756
I feel lost.

38:36.272 --> 38:37.231
Mu-deok.

38:39.191 --> 38:40.234
I miss you.

39:14.393 --> 39:16.479
Pretend you know nothing,
even if they catch me.

39:16.562 --> 39:19.899
Not a single soul in Songrim would ever
allow that thing to attack me.

39:26.238 --> 39:27.948
Then I'll ask this
of you, Jang Uk.

39:28.032 --> 39:29.408
Please take me up there.

39:30.576 --> 39:31.410
Sure.

39:31.494 --> 39:34.955
I'll take you to the top
of wherever you want to go.

40:07.780 --> 40:08.697
Mu-deok.

40:09.240 --> 40:10.157
What's happening?

40:12.535 --> 40:13.702
She is here!

40:13.786 --> 40:14.662
Who?

40:15.579 --> 40:17.206
It is her. The blind girl!

40:18.290 --> 40:19.375
It's the ice stone!

40:24.046 --> 40:25.464
The mirror is going to shatter.

40:26.215 --> 40:27.174
Step back.

41:30.905 --> 41:31.864
Young Master.

41:32.448 --> 41:33.282
Mu-deok.

41:33.782 --> 41:36.118
- Are you all right?
- Uh-huh, I'm all right.

41:36.202 --> 41:38.120
- Is Mu-deok all right?
- Yes, Of course.

42:07.358 --> 42:09.944
I fell while bringing out
the yin-yang jade.

42:11.111 --> 42:13.405
I think that was when it broke.

42:14.698 --> 42:17.535
So you tried to blame
a servant for the broken jade.

42:19.370 --> 42:20.621
What about the Mirror of Longing?

42:21.830 --> 42:23.749
I remember it was next to me when I fell,

42:24.416 --> 42:25.543
but I didn't touch it.

42:26.168 --> 42:29.213
How could Uk possibly break
the mirror with his abilities?

42:30.297 --> 42:31.590
Then I suppose

42:31.674 --> 42:34.843
I must have somehow also
harmed the mirror when I fell.

42:38.973 --> 42:40.182
Was it you

42:40.933 --> 42:44.019
who locked Mu-deok
in Jinyowon, Young Lady Jin?

42:44.103 --> 42:47.731
I did seal the door,
but she'd already opened it herself.

42:47.815 --> 42:51.569
That door can't be opened
by anyone outside the Jin family.

42:53.237 --> 42:54.738
But you're saying Mu-deok opened it?

42:56.824 --> 42:58.242
Then I suppose…

42:59.201 --> 43:00.828
I must have opened the door.

43:01.620 --> 43:04.498
I saw her go inside
and I locked her in there.

43:07.167 --> 43:08.210
Please, forgive me!

43:09.753 --> 43:10.921
I'll tell everyone…

43:12.715 --> 43:15.634
that they should keep quiet
about this whole incident.

43:18.178 --> 43:21.181
Considering your reputation,
I'll keep quiet as well.

43:22.433 --> 43:24.184
I deeply apologize.

43:28.105 --> 43:29.148
Are you all right?

43:30.107 --> 43:31.442
You're still unable to see?

43:33.277 --> 43:34.111
Yes.

43:34.737 --> 43:37.031
When the mirror broke,
I saw a really bright light.

43:37.656 --> 43:39.199
And now I can't open my eyes.

43:42.494 --> 43:44.413
We should protect
your eyes from the light.

43:47.875 --> 43:48.751
Here.

43:49.335 --> 43:50.169
Oh.

43:53.589 --> 43:55.674
Usually, if you stare at the sun too long,

43:55.758 --> 43:57.217
you can't see for a little bit.

43:58.135 --> 43:59.345
I'm sure you'll recover soon.

44:01.096 --> 44:02.598
I am sorry for this.

44:03.182 --> 44:04.600
What have you done wrong?

44:05.434 --> 44:07.019
Young Lady Jin is at fault.

44:17.738 --> 44:19.531
Are you all right, Mu-deok?

44:20.115 --> 44:21.909
What are you doing here,
Young Master Park?

44:21.992 --> 44:22.826
Oh, my goodness!

44:24.620 --> 44:26.038
I came because I was worried.

44:26.664 --> 44:27.790
I see you've hurt your eyes.

44:28.624 --> 44:30.250
You're here, too, Young Master Seo?

44:34.755 --> 44:37.883
You should be treated at Sejukwon.
I'll take you there.

44:37.966 --> 44:39.885
The palace is nearby.
She will go there.

44:40.386 --> 44:42.638
Huh, Your Highness is here, too?

44:48.143 --> 44:49.895
I will take you to the royal clinic.

44:50.521 --> 44:51.897
That's not necessary.

44:51.980 --> 44:55.234
She's temporarily blinded by the light.
But she's not injured.

44:56.276 --> 44:59.405
I know you didn't plan any of this,
but they came here for you.

44:59.488 --> 45:02.199
You should apologize,
thank them, and bid them farewell.

45:04.702 --> 45:06.704
I apologize for this.

45:07.371 --> 45:08.872
Thank you very much.

45:21.343 --> 45:22.302
Young Master.

45:24.054 --> 45:25.097
Let's go home now.

45:49.288 --> 45:51.123
After what happened today,

45:52.458 --> 45:55.252
I'm doubtful the wedding will
proceed as planned.

45:55.335 --> 45:56.628
Did you hear what she said?

45:57.546 --> 46:01.091
She was going to close the door
even if the Young Master would die.

46:01.175 --> 46:02.301
How terrifying!

46:02.384 --> 46:05.387
Sending him to live
with a mother-in-law like that worries me.

46:05.471 --> 46:07.556
She made that choice to protect Jinyowon.

46:08.307 --> 46:11.018
When you have a lot to protect, sometimes…

46:12.019 --> 46:13.520
you have no choice but to be heartless.

46:14.188 --> 46:15.022
So, then…

46:16.273 --> 46:17.983
are you saying
you would have done the same?

46:19.401 --> 46:22.279
I'd say that you and I are rather close.

46:22.362 --> 46:23.989
What if I were locked inside?

46:24.072 --> 46:25.783
Would you seal the door?

46:26.658 --> 46:27.576
Heartlessly?

46:32.206 --> 46:33.165
Oh, my!

46:34.208 --> 46:35.417
So, you would seal it?

46:36.794 --> 46:38.921
Even if it meant I might die in there?

46:39.004 --> 46:41.089
Don't overthink it, though.

46:42.674 --> 46:44.301
Nothing has even happened yet.

46:44.384 --> 46:46.845
I am not even actually locked inside.

46:46.929 --> 46:49.348
Would it be too much
to ask you to lie and say

46:49.431 --> 46:51.642
- "I'll never seal the door"?
- I…

46:52.142 --> 46:55.145
cannot give you empty words.

46:57.648 --> 46:58.649
Indeed.

46:59.858 --> 47:01.902
That is the kind of man you are after all.

47:06.323 --> 47:08.492
Well, just speak with
the Young Master before you leave.

47:09.159 --> 47:10.369
No.

47:10.452 --> 47:12.996
I mean, what could I
possibly have to say to Jang Uk.

47:14.248 --> 47:16.333
I can't give him empty words.

47:17.125 --> 47:17.960
Yes.

47:18.961 --> 47:20.212
Thank you for your help today.

47:20.796 --> 47:21.630
Goodbye.

47:31.348 --> 47:32.391
But know this…

47:34.768 --> 47:36.353
if I did have to seal it,

47:37.855 --> 47:39.481
my heart would be shattered…

47:42.234 --> 47:43.277
to pieces.

47:51.201 --> 47:53.996
He's so slow-witted and stubborn.

47:56.206 --> 47:58.792
"How could I seal the door
with you inside?"

48:00.294 --> 48:02.379
Is that so hard for you to say?

48:17.769 --> 48:18.979
That was dangerous.

48:21.064 --> 48:22.482
Entering Jinyowon

48:22.566 --> 48:25.152
was reckless, childish and stubborn.

48:25.235 --> 48:27.029
You don't need to be so angry.

48:28.363 --> 48:30.449
Your perception of me as pathetic…

48:31.491 --> 48:32.576
is an illusion.

48:34.620 --> 48:35.454
What?

48:35.537 --> 48:37.623
The mirror inside Jinyowon said it.

48:38.332 --> 48:40.167
It said that what people see

48:40.250 --> 48:42.419
are delusions of what they wish to see.

48:43.503 --> 48:44.463
It's an illusion.

48:44.546 --> 48:46.798
Are you saying that
I see you as an illusion?

48:46.882 --> 48:47.716
If not…

48:49.176 --> 48:51.219
why do you tell me to not do anything?

48:54.598 --> 48:56.308
Throughout my life, I tried

48:57.434 --> 49:00.354
so hard to prove
that I was my father's son. But…

49:02.022 --> 49:04.107
even though it hurt
when you told me I wasn't,

49:04.191 --> 49:05.317
it shattered my delusion.

49:06.026 --> 49:07.527
But after all of that,

49:07.611 --> 49:09.780
how can you tell me
to go on living that illusion?

49:09.863 --> 49:11.365
I don't care about this.

49:12.699 --> 49:14.242
Illusion nonsense.

49:15.452 --> 49:16.411
My only wish…

49:18.330 --> 49:20.248
is for you to be safe and sound.

49:24.211 --> 49:27.673
The delusion I tried so hard
to prove my whole life is shattered.

49:29.967 --> 49:31.385
So from this point on,

49:32.886 --> 49:34.262
I'll fight harder…

49:35.847 --> 49:36.890
to find out…

49:38.767 --> 49:40.268
the truth about who I am.

50:11.633 --> 50:12.467
Can you see?

50:13.802 --> 50:15.804
Yes, I can.

50:20.726 --> 50:21.560
What?

50:21.643 --> 50:23.937
I was told that
the mirror was making illusions of you.

50:24.021 --> 50:26.982
So I'm checking that the one
I pulled out is the real Mu-deok.

50:28.233 --> 50:30.652
You didn't pull me out.
I broke the mirror myself.

50:31.528 --> 50:32.362
Hmm?

50:32.446 --> 50:34.781
While I was inside that strange place,

50:34.865 --> 50:36.867
I temporarily regained my energy

50:36.950 --> 50:38.952
just like at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

50:39.953 --> 50:42.247
I'm sure I broke the mirror
with my own power.

50:42.330 --> 50:43.915
You think so?

50:43.999 --> 50:46.084
I was so excited thinking that I broke it.

50:46.168 --> 50:47.252
Not at all.

50:47.335 --> 50:49.963
At your level, you should be grateful
it didn't suck you in.

50:50.047 --> 50:53.050
I did think about going into
the mirror because you were inside.

50:53.133 --> 50:55.093
That's such a foolish idea.

50:55.177 --> 50:57.095
Unless it swallowed you and spit me out.

50:57.179 --> 50:59.514
So if it had swallowed me,
that would be a good idea?

50:59.598 --> 51:00.974
Well, then I would have survived.

51:01.058 --> 51:02.392
And then, I would have died.

51:04.144 --> 51:07.147
My pupil, when there's no
other alternative,

51:07.230 --> 51:09.024
it's only right
that you sacrifice yourself

51:09.107 --> 51:10.442
to save your master.

51:10.525 --> 51:11.860
No, I don't want to.

51:13.320 --> 51:14.696
If I die, you should die beside me.

51:14.780 --> 51:17.032
Don't think that you're going
to survive here by yourself.

51:17.532 --> 51:19.785
You have no other choice.

51:19.868 --> 51:21.161
When you put your pupil in danger,

51:21.244 --> 51:23.080
the master should be prepared
to die as well.

51:23.997 --> 51:26.875
- All right. I'll keep that in mind.
- Hmm.

51:26.958 --> 51:28.877
But what about your engagement

51:28.960 --> 51:31.671
to the woman
who almost killed your master?

51:32.714 --> 51:35.675
Marrying Jin Cho-yeon will certainly
guarantee my safety.

51:39.012 --> 51:40.764
But if his master nearly died

51:41.431 --> 51:43.225
then the pupil should risk his life, too.

51:49.689 --> 51:52.025
This is a marriage
of convenience,

51:52.109 --> 51:55.278
so let us resolve
any emotional issues after the wedding.

51:55.362 --> 51:58.115
The reason that
the Jin family needs me for a son-in-law

51:58.824 --> 52:00.325
is because I'm Jang Gang's son

52:00.408 --> 52:02.410
and next in line to become
Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

52:03.286 --> 52:05.413
Think of it as our families
combining strength.

52:06.373 --> 52:09.251
Yes. Since this is
a marriage of convenience,

52:10.210 --> 52:12.671
we should be honest
about what we can offer each other.

52:13.463 --> 52:15.966
Apparently, I am not the son
of the Gwanju, Jang Gang.

52:18.844 --> 52:20.846
I do not care about such rumors.

52:23.306 --> 52:25.142
But what if that rumor turns out…

52:26.434 --> 52:27.394
to be true?

52:30.313 --> 52:32.232
Think about whether or not you're willing

52:32.983 --> 52:35.861
to take that risk to have me
as the Jin family's son-in-law.

52:48.081 --> 52:50.584
I see you still have
the binding bracelet on.

52:50.667 --> 52:51.918
Ah.

52:53.420 --> 52:54.629
Yes.

52:57.674 --> 52:59.676
And you're as impudent as ever, too.

53:08.935 --> 53:12.772
Why did you decide to marry off Cho-yeon
without even discussing it with me?

53:13.899 --> 53:17.277
Who do you think you are
to meddle in our family matters?

53:17.360 --> 53:18.278
Sister.

53:20.697 --> 53:22.115
It's also my family.

53:23.867 --> 53:28.496
The name "Jin" is only given
to those children born of Jin mothers.

53:29.748 --> 53:33.460
My mother was a fool to have given
our family name to someone like you,

53:34.127 --> 53:36.296
conceived elsewhere by our father.

53:37.005 --> 53:40.217
As soon as you became
leader of Jinyowon, you chased me out.

53:41.176 --> 53:43.470
To this day,
you still resent me that much?

53:43.553 --> 53:44.763
I don't resent you.

53:45.889 --> 53:47.432
I detest you.

53:50.393 --> 53:53.104
I detest that slyness of yours.

53:56.983 --> 54:00.779
The leader of Jinyowon should not
make decisions based on preference.

54:01.446 --> 54:03.949
Choosing Jang Uk was the wrong decision.

54:04.032 --> 54:05.450
Call off the marriage.

54:05.533 --> 54:06.743
What?

54:07.452 --> 54:11.289
I'll give you
a much better card than Jang Uk.

54:12.040 --> 54:13.375
How would you like

54:14.251 --> 54:15.877
the Crown Prince as your son-in-law?

54:19.839 --> 54:23.218
You expect the Crown Prince
to come live with our family?

54:23.885 --> 54:25.553
Cho-yeon is the second daughter.

54:25.637 --> 54:28.181
It's Bu-yeon, your eldest,
who will lead the family.

54:29.140 --> 54:31.268
Why must Cho-yeon's husband move in

54:31.351 --> 54:32.936
when there's also Bu-yeon?

54:34.479 --> 54:38.650
What are you planning…
that you dare to speak of Bu-yeon?

54:43.405 --> 54:46.950
I understand that your husband is
still searching for Bu-yeon.

54:47.575 --> 54:50.245
And as the Assistant Gwanju
of Cheonbugwan,

54:50.328 --> 54:52.622
I'll do everything
in my power to find the daughter…

54:53.790 --> 54:55.208
that you've been longing for.

54:57.043 --> 54:59.629
I'll find Bu-yeon
and make her leader of Jinyowon,

54:59.713 --> 55:03.967
and I'll make Cho-yeon queen.
So please, do not marry her to Jang Uk.

55:06.511 --> 55:07.595
Your brother…

55:08.513 --> 55:11.808
will become Cheonbugwan's Gwanju
and an ally to Jinyowon,

55:13.435 --> 55:15.520
because I am a part
of this family, after all.

55:30.744 --> 55:33.705
Hey, Yul. I've been
wondering about something.

55:34.414 --> 55:36.291
What was it that made you
think about Mu-deok?

55:37.751 --> 55:39.461
I was not thinking about Mu-deok.

55:40.628 --> 55:43.465
I also find it odd
that the illusion appeared as her

55:44.215 --> 55:46.051
- and said that.
- What did it say to you?

55:47.010 --> 55:48.178
Hey, hey, Yul.

55:48.261 --> 55:49.596
It's this way!

55:50.263 --> 55:53.016
Why do you keep going the wrong way?
What exactly is going on with you?

55:57.687 --> 55:58.813
I will be fine.

56:01.900 --> 56:02.859
Goodness!

56:05.070 --> 56:05.904
Huh?

56:06.571 --> 56:07.947
It's package delivery.

56:09.157 --> 56:12.952
Young Lady Jin's marriage gifts
should be delivered to Songrim today.

56:13.745 --> 56:15.622
No one should see them.

56:16.706 --> 56:18.166
I'd better go and receive them.

56:31.137 --> 56:33.598
Ah! The bird!
The bird! Catch the bird!

56:33.681 --> 56:34.974
- Quick! Catch it!
- Oh, oh, no!

56:35.642 --> 56:37.018
Where is it going?

56:38.311 --> 56:40.230
There, there, there, there!
Come on!

56:40.313 --> 56:41.231
Come on! Oh!

56:41.314 --> 56:42.816
Seriously!

56:43.817 --> 56:45.443
No, no, no, no!

57:20.145 --> 57:22.230
Naksu uses the alchemy of souls.

57:25.316 --> 57:28.987
What if Naksu shifted her soul
into another woman's body?

57:36.035 --> 57:38.538
You were longing for
the one you met at Danhyanggok.

57:39.914 --> 57:41.624
If you keep thinking of me,

57:43.501 --> 57:44.836
I will visit you.

57:46.421 --> 57:50.216
Winter in Danhyanggok is
much warmer than you would think.

57:51.217 --> 57:54.471
As soon as the sun rises,
the snow tends to melt pretty quickly.

58:01.644 --> 58:02.604
Mu-deok…

58:04.230 --> 58:05.398
is Naksu.

59:07.919 --> 59:11.005
You left this at Danhyanggok, Naksu.

59:16.344 --> 59:18.721
After all this time, I've found you.

59:41.119 --> 59:41.953
Mu-deok.

59:42.787 --> 59:44.414
Do you know how long
I've been waiting for you?

59:45.081 --> 59:46.583
Maidservant Kim didn't tell you?

59:46.666 --> 59:48.293
You were supposed to be here by noon.

59:50.169 --> 59:53.006
Let's go. We'll get
to Danhyanggok by sunset.

59:53.089 --> 59:54.257
Instead of Danhyanggok…

59:56.467 --> 59:57.885
let us go somewhere else.

59:59.053 --> 01:00:00.138
Like where?

01:00:01.180 --> 01:00:03.641
There is an empty temple
by the eastern forest.

01:00:04.267 --> 01:00:05.351
Let us go there.

01:00:11.691 --> 01:00:14.027
If you bring
Jang Uk here tonight,

01:00:14.110 --> 01:00:15.653
then I shall spare your life.

01:00:21.492 --> 01:00:23.494
I must sacrifice you to survive.

01:00:24.287 --> 01:00:25.538
It is only right.

01:00:28.124 --> 01:00:29.334
The marriage is off.

01:00:30.585 --> 01:00:32.545
I gave them an excuse to get rid of me.

01:00:33.546 --> 01:00:34.380
I see.

01:00:35.423 --> 01:00:36.466
But…

01:00:39.636 --> 01:00:42.347
Maidservant Kim already received
the yin-yang jade.

01:00:43.014 --> 01:00:44.724
So I made something out of it.

01:00:52.148 --> 01:00:53.900
- Bird's eggs.
- Yes.

01:00:54.567 --> 01:00:56.027
Pick one. We'll each keep one, okay?

01:00:59.989 --> 01:01:02.283
Oh, you know how strange
our relationship is.

01:01:02.367 --> 01:01:05.078
Young master and servant.
Pupil and master.

01:01:05.161 --> 01:01:08.206
So I made them as a token for us
so we can remember to stay, um…

01:01:08.998 --> 01:01:10.541
dutiful and loyal.

01:01:14.253 --> 01:01:15.505
Or I can just choose.

01:01:15.588 --> 01:01:17.423
I pick red. You can have blue.

01:01:21.803 --> 01:01:25.848
Master, let us stay forever
loyal and dutiful to each other.

01:01:32.855 --> 01:01:34.816
- Jang Uk.
- Hmm?

01:01:37.402 --> 01:01:38.986
Let us part ways here.

01:01:43.533 --> 01:01:45.368
I will return to where I came from.

01:01:47.620 --> 01:01:50.289
- But they abandoned you, didn't they?
- I met them today.

01:01:51.165 --> 01:01:52.542
They know who I am now.

01:01:53.501 --> 01:01:55.253
And they asked me to come back with them.

01:01:55.336 --> 01:01:58.172
- You said they were dangerous, though.
- As you can see, I am alive and well.

01:01:58.798 --> 01:02:01.175
If they wanted to kill me,
they would have done it already.

01:02:01.843 --> 01:02:05.847
If I go back to them,
I will be able to retrieve my energy.

01:02:13.980 --> 01:02:14.981
I promised to do that.

01:02:15.064 --> 01:02:17.608
I told you that
I'd push you to the edge of a cliff.

01:02:18.901 --> 01:02:22.155
It's true. I pushed you too far.

01:02:24.240 --> 01:02:26.033
And you did try your best.

01:02:26.784 --> 01:02:28.661
- And we can keep doing that together.
- No.

01:02:29.245 --> 01:02:32.290
If we stay together, you will die,

01:02:33.040 --> 01:02:34.459
and I will get caught.

01:02:55.938 --> 01:03:00.109
What business does the leader of Songrim
have to ask to meet me in secret?

01:03:00.193 --> 01:03:01.652
I need to ask you

01:03:02.320 --> 01:03:06.365
about a Cheonbugwan mage
from 20 years ago named Cho Chung.

01:03:11.788 --> 01:03:13.581
Naksu's father, Cho Chung,

01:03:14.499 --> 01:03:15.666
was a soul shifter.

01:03:17.668 --> 01:03:19.337
By the time we found him,

01:03:20.129 --> 01:03:22.006
he had already run wild.

01:03:22.507 --> 01:03:26.427
He had massacred
nearly everyone in his family.

01:03:33.351 --> 01:03:35.478
The four families had to get involved

01:03:36.187 --> 01:03:37.814
to put an end to the killing.

01:03:45.154 --> 01:03:47.907
So, Naksu's father was a soul shifter?

01:03:48.574 --> 01:03:50.201
To a child,

01:03:50.284 --> 01:03:53.830
we must have looked like
murderers who killed her father.

01:03:56.040 --> 01:03:59.126
She must have thought
her father was murdered by us.

01:03:59.919 --> 01:04:02.505
That's probably why
she became an assassin.

01:04:04.799 --> 01:04:07.718
What's this important matter
you wanted to talk about?

01:04:07.802 --> 01:04:10.596
Have you… recalled it?

01:04:14.767 --> 01:04:17.895
If I see you again,
I won't hesitate to kill you.

01:04:23.025 --> 01:04:24.902
Are you implying that I, Jin Mu,

01:04:24.986 --> 01:04:28.281
took in Cho Chung's daughter
and trained her to become an assassin?

01:04:28.364 --> 01:04:31.659
I assume that the reason you burned
Naksu's body as soon as you found it

01:04:31.742 --> 01:04:34.161
was because you were afraid that
her identity might be revealed,

01:04:34.245 --> 01:04:35.371
was it not?

01:04:36.998 --> 01:04:40.459
Instead of saying what you wish to hear,
I'll tell you what actually happened.

01:04:44.088 --> 01:04:46.007
At Cheonbugwan, we record the stars

01:04:46.090 --> 01:04:48.634
with the most energy
every night from 1 to 3 a.m.

01:04:49.343 --> 01:04:53.055
Then, after the Gwanju checks it
later that day, the record is stored here.

01:04:54.348 --> 01:04:59.312
But one day, a constellation plate
recorded that night disappeared.

01:05:01.314 --> 01:05:04.567
Fortunately, it was soon found,
and the incident was resolved.

01:05:07.194 --> 01:05:09.906
So, why are you telling me this, Jin Mu?

01:05:13.743 --> 01:05:17.622
It was the day Jang Gang's wife, Do-hwa,
died while giving birth to Jang Uk.

01:05:18.789 --> 01:05:20.833
Cho Chung recorded the stars that day,

01:05:20.917 --> 01:05:24.337
and the one who discovered
the missing plate was me.

01:05:37.475 --> 01:05:38.684
KING GO SUN, YEAR ONE
FIRST DAY OF APRIL

01:05:38.768 --> 01:05:41.187
I've already stolen the plate
that recorded the stars that night.

01:05:41.270 --> 01:05:44.649
The one in Cheonbugwan
is a fake without the King's Star.

01:05:50.237 --> 01:05:51.822
Are you telling me

01:05:51.906 --> 01:05:53.950
that you know what really happened

01:05:55.076 --> 01:05:57.036
the day that Jang Gang's son…

01:05:58.871 --> 01:06:00.289
Jang Uk, was born?

01:06:03.876 --> 01:06:07.129
A star that would bring disorder
to the world appeared that night.

01:06:12.385 --> 01:06:15.054
So, you knew about the King's Star?

01:06:15.137 --> 01:06:18.015
Do you think the secret was erased
with Cho Chung's death?

01:06:19.600 --> 01:06:20.893
Who do you think performed

01:06:20.977 --> 01:06:23.020
the alchemy of souls
that caused his death?

01:06:26.065 --> 01:06:29.235
Do not ask questions
you do not wish to hear the answers to

01:06:29.318 --> 01:06:32.071
if you want to protect
Songrim and your people.

01:06:44.792 --> 01:06:48.045
The Danju does not yet know
that you are still alive, Naksu.

01:06:49.922 --> 01:06:51.257
I did not tell him.

01:06:52.258 --> 01:06:53.634
Bring Jang Uk to me.

01:06:53.718 --> 01:06:55.761
And my lips will remain sealed.

01:07:00.307 --> 01:07:02.768
I will shift my soul into his body.

01:07:22.288 --> 01:07:23.164
Where is Jang Uk?

01:07:24.415 --> 01:07:25.624
He will be here soon.

01:07:32.548 --> 01:07:34.800
What brings you here
at such a late hour?

01:07:38.512 --> 01:07:40.014
Before Uk was ever born,

01:07:41.140 --> 01:07:43.392
close to about 20 years ago,

01:07:43.476 --> 01:07:44.769
did Jang Gang…

01:07:46.187 --> 01:07:48.105
master a type of sorcery?

01:07:51.442 --> 01:07:52.818
Did Jang Gang…

01:07:54.361 --> 01:07:55.988
perform the alchemy of souls?

01:08:11.754 --> 01:08:13.089
What's taking him so long?

01:08:16.592 --> 01:08:18.052
It is finally raining now.

01:08:19.011 --> 01:08:20.346
He should be here.

01:08:24.600 --> 01:08:25.935
Did you try to fool me?

01:08:28.270 --> 01:08:30.314
Why are you stalling for time?

01:08:31.857 --> 01:08:34.944
Seeing as how the Danju
still has not shown up here yet,

01:08:35.027 --> 01:08:37.404
you really must be
the only one who knows about me.

01:08:39.323 --> 01:08:40.616
You little…

01:09:05.015 --> 01:09:06.350
Let us end things here.

01:09:08.394 --> 01:09:10.604
What about the empty temple by the forest?

01:09:12.273 --> 01:09:14.900
Why were you taking me all the way
up here just to end things like this?

01:09:14.984 --> 01:09:17.069
I was going to hand you over to them.

01:09:18.904 --> 01:09:20.948
Now you know, so don't follow me.

01:09:21.657 --> 01:09:22.533
If that's what you want,

01:09:22.616 --> 01:09:24.285
then you shouldn't
have told me about the temple.

01:09:25.744 --> 01:09:27.830
If you leave after saying
such ominous things,

01:09:28.581 --> 01:09:30.583
how can I not follow you, Mu-deok?

01:09:33.836 --> 01:09:35.337
I'm more upset than you are.

01:09:35.421 --> 01:09:37.965
I gave up my chance to live
just for this bird's egg.

01:09:38.048 --> 01:09:40.176
I'm glad that I reminded you to be loyal.

01:09:40.259 --> 01:09:41.802
If I had not, I truly could have died.

01:09:45.931 --> 01:09:47.516
Now that I helped you escape death,

01:09:49.143 --> 01:09:51.145
fight like your life depends on it,
my pupil.

01:09:52.229 --> 01:09:55.900
If you say it like that, it…
it sounds like you saved my life.

01:09:57.401 --> 01:09:59.862
If we're lucky
and that cloudy sky brings us rain,

01:10:01.739 --> 01:10:03.782
then we both might be able to live.

01:10:12.583 --> 01:10:14.627
Jang Uk, you truly are lucky.

01:10:14.710 --> 01:10:16.629
It's really raining quite a bit.

01:10:17.671 --> 01:10:19.757
I can't be that lucky with that opponent.

01:10:21.008 --> 01:10:22.176
A mage of Cheonbugwan.

01:10:22.718 --> 01:10:24.303
Hi. Don't you remember me?

01:12:38.312 --> 01:12:40.397
It is time. Use Tansu.

01:12:40.481 --> 01:12:43.692
Instead of trying to meet the water-drops
with a sword you can't control,

01:12:43.776 --> 01:12:45.778
wield the sword
so that water-drops meet it.

01:13:44.628 --> 01:13:45.462
Oh, no.

01:13:49.550 --> 01:13:50.676
What is that?

01:13:50.759 --> 01:13:51.885
Alchemy of souls.

01:14:43.562 --> 01:14:44.730
Is my soul

01:14:45.647 --> 01:14:46.857
being shifted right now?

01:15:09.046 --> 01:15:10.464
Jang Uk! Jang Uk!

01:15:11.798 --> 01:15:15.511
Gil-ju, you bastard!
You managed to steal his body after all.

01:15:15.594 --> 01:15:18.138
I'm afraid Uk's fallen victim
to the alchemy of souls.

01:15:18.222 --> 01:15:19.139
What?

01:15:19.223 --> 01:15:21.141
Is the person
who shifted my father's soul

01:15:21.808 --> 01:15:23.936
Jin Mu as in Cheonbugwan?

01:15:26.104 --> 01:15:28.482
Why is it you?
Why does it have to be you again?

01:15:28.565 --> 01:15:32.277
Are you certain that the ice stone
has truly been rid from this world?

01:15:32.361 --> 01:15:33.237
Hemp Master Lee ordered

01:15:33.320 --> 01:15:35.155
all of the mages
in Cheonbugwan to search for him.

01:15:35.239 --> 01:15:37.824
It must never be revealed
that they are soul shifters.
